WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000022760 — Episode 43 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.280
What are you doing?

2
00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:07.140
My blood won't hold back her bloodline surge for long.

3
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.740
Get Thaddeus here. Now.

4
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:22.840
Thaddeus, how do we stop the flare-ups for good?

5
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.340
Amber is half human, half dragon.

6
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:28.340
Her human body can't carry that power.

7
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.840
There is only one way.

8
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.180
The heart of the Leviathan.

9
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.680
The great sea beast of the deep.

10
00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.680
According to ancient texts, the Leviathan is the oldest creature recorded.

11
00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.680
Older than dragons, older than time itself,

12
00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.680
its heart can reshape any living form.

13
00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:49.680
The Leviathan sleeps miles beneath the sea.

14
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:55.680
Countless warriors have gone looking for it, but none ever returned.

15
00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:04.220
I will kill the Leviathan and bring back its heart.

16
00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:07.220
It's too risky. There has to be another way.

17
00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:21.260
There isn't, for me Lyra.
